    "The middle occurrence of each text fits in the frame and its safe area: it is what is read, and no line of it runs past the measure. The other occurrences are decor, cut by the frame on purpose.",
    "Nothing pulses or drifts once locked.",
    "On the way out each band leaves by the side opposite to the one it came from, so the two cross.",
